OL,3,GNEWSACouncil considers new operator for
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is considering taking on a
OL,7,Fnew operator to run a Barrow leisure
OL,8,Fcentre to ensure it remains remains "a
OL,9,Fthriving and accessible community
OL,10,Fasset".
OL,12,FWestmorland and Furness Council said it
OL,13,Fwas "committed to securing the
OL,14,Flong-term financial sustainability" of
OL,15,FBarrow Park Leisure Centre.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
