OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil considers new operator for
OL,4,Aleisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,F"By building on the centre's existing
OL,7,Fstrengths, the proposal aims to
OL,8,Fsafeguard key services, support ongoing
OL,9,Finvestment in the facility, and
OL,10,Fmaintain a strong focus on
OL,11,Faccessibility, inclusion and community
OL,12,Fwellbeing," a spokesperson said.
OL,14,FThe local authority said all leisure
OL,15,Fcentre employees were "fundamental to
OL,16,Fthe delivery of high-quality services"
OL,17,Fand would be supported throughout any
OL,18,Ftransition.
